error E0101: a service tool returns only its state  tests/errors/e0101/main.mo:5:9

  5 |   tools increment
    |         ^^^^^^^^^ a timer returns this; a tool returns (Int, reply)

A tool changes the state only by returning (state, reply). Returning the state alone is how a timer changes it, so a tool's result would never be saved (reference 11.5).

